Third-party runtime linked into web/megacorp.wasm
-------------------------------------------------
AdaWebPack 22.1.0 (https://github.com/godunko/adawebpack)
provides the GNAT runtime archive libgnat.a that the WebAssembly
module is linked with. That runtime is:

  GPL-3.0 WITH GCC-exception-3.1
  (GNU General Public License v3.0 with the GCC Runtime Library
  Exception, version 3.1)

The compiler is GNAT (an Eligible Compilation Process under that
exception). The exception gives permission to convey the combined
module under the terms of the rest of this project, which are MIT.
It does not make Megacorp Simulator a GPL program, and it does not
require the MIT sources to be relicensed.

The AdaWebPack compiler and the runtime sources are not committed.
megacorp/wasm/build.sh downloads the compiler when the module is
rebuilt. The stubs written for this project (Text_IO, To_Upper,
and the two C helpers) are MIT.
